{"error": false, "page": 1, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 1, "recordCount": 35, "data": [{"docid2": 2214620, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "儿童福利和孤儿基本生活保障", "chnldocurl": "http://cz.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/czxw/202606/t20260608_2214620.htm", "content": "　　为进一步保障孤儿及事实无人抚养儿童生活，落实孤儿基本生活最低养育标准自然增长机制，今年7月1日起，我省孤儿基本生活最低养育标准与2025年我省居民人均可支配收入实际增幅同幅度增长。集中养育孤儿由每人每月", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "7月1日起实施！孤儿基本生活最低养育标准提高！", "docpuburl": "http://cz.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/czxw/202606/t20260608_2214620.htm", "docreltime": "2026.06.08 17:34:00", "doctitle": "7月1日起实施！孤儿基本生活最低养育标准提高！", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2426948, "sourcename": "福建省财政厅", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://cz.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/czxw/202606/t20260608_2214620.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://cz.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/czxw/202606/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2196422, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "儿童福利和孤儿基本生活保障", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202603/t20260325_2196422.htm", "content": "　　寒梅吐蕊迎新春，温情守护暖童心。2026年寒假春节来临之际，市民政局启动“把爱带回家——暖心护航伴成长”活动，从走访慰问、主题活动、安全守护三维发力，为全市留守、困境儿童送上全方位关爱，让孩子们在这个", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://mzj.sm.gov.cn/xwzx/sjdt/202603/t20260325_2196422.htm", "docreltime": "2026.02.13 09:14:00", "doctitle": "暖冬护苗，爱伴新春！全市民政系统关爱留守困境儿童在行动", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2406046, "sourcename": "三明市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://mzj.sm.gov.cn/xwzx/sjdt/202603/t20260325_2196422.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "2.jpg", "appdocid": 2196422, "appfile": "W020260325334968260644.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202603/W020260325/W020260325334968260644.jpg", "_href": "http://mzj.sm.gov.cn/xwzx/sjdt/202603/W020260325334968260644.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://mzj.sm.gov.cn/xwzx/sjdt/202603/", "_firstpic": "http://mzj.sm.gov.cn/xwzx/sjdt/202603/W020260325334968260644.jpg", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2186206, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "儿童福利和孤儿基本生活保障", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202601/t20260126_2186206.htm", "content": "　　近年来，福建省三明市聚焦流动儿童基本生活、教育公平、安全防护、心理健康等核心需求，探索“三联三重三化”工作模式，推动流动儿童关爱保护工作从“零散化”向“系统化”、从“被动响应”向“主动介入”转变，", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://mzj.sm.gov.cn/xwzx/sjdt/202601/t20260126_2186206.htm", "docreltime": "2026.01.07 08:39:00", "doctitle": "构建流动儿童关爱体系 绘就幸福成长新图景", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2394062, "sourcename": "中国儿童福利", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://mzj.sm.gov.cn/xwzx/sjdt/202601/t20260126_2186206.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://mzj.sm.gov.cn/xwzx/sjdt/202601/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2176570, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "儿童福利和孤儿基本生活保障", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202512/t20251215_2176570.htm", "content": "\n　　近年来，三明市聚焦流动儿童基本生活、教育公平、安全防护、心理健康等核心需求，积极探索“三联三重三化”工作模式，推动流动儿童关爱保护工作从“零散化”向“系统化”、“被动响应”向“主动介入”转变，显著", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202512/t20251215_2176570.htm", "docreltime": "2025.12.01 09:33:00", "doctitle": "三明市构建流动儿童关爱体系 绘就幸福成长新图景", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2382505, "sourcename": "应急管理部宣传教育中心", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202512/t20251215_2176570.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202512/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2126971, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "儿童福利和孤儿基本生活保障", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/msfwtp/yysy/etgafw/nclsetgabh/202505/t20250529_2126971.htm", "content": "\n　　近年来，我市深入开展“福蕾行动计划”、“雏燕”关爱行动，通过健全协作体系、强化要素赋能、创新服务模式，用心用情呵护全市流动、留守儿童健康成长，推动儿童关爱事业高质量发展。\n　　突出“三项联动”，一", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/msfwtp/yysy/etgafw/nclsetgabh/202505/t20250529_2126971.htm", "docreltime": "2025.05.22 12:13:00", "doctitle": "我市强化“三个突出”  护航儿童成长", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2323806, "sourcename": "三明市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/msfwtp/yysy/etgafw/nclsetgabh/202505/t20250529_2126971.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "03", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/msfwtp/yysy/etgafw/nclsetgabh/202505/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2120648, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "儿童福利和孤儿基本生活保障", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/msfwtp/yysy/etgafw/kjetbz/202504/t20250430_2120648.htm", "content": "\n　　一是交流合作赋能。深化沪明合作，与上海市儿童福利基金会签订协议，获援助26万余元，在三元区、将乐县实施困境留守儿童服务项目。二是队伍建设赋能。配备专兼职儿童福利工作人员2千余人，培养专业社工1千余人，", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/msfwtp/yysy/etgafw/kjetbz/202504/t20250430_2120648.htm", "docreltime": "2025.04.30 18:26:00", "doctitle": "我市三项赋能提升儿童关爱水平。", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2316566, "sourcename": "三明市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/msfwtp/yysy/etgafw/kjetbz/202504/t20250430_2120648.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "03", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/msfwtp/yysy/etgafw/kjetbz/202504/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2105643, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "儿童福利和孤儿基本生活保障", "chnldocurl": "http://mzj.sm.gov.cn/xwzx/sjdt/202503/t20250310_2105643.htm", "content": "\n　　近期，市民政局联合公安、法院、检察院、教育、卫健等多个部门，共同印发了《三明市流动儿童关爱保护专项行动实施方案》（以下简称《方案》），切实帮助流动儿童及其家庭解决生活、监护、教育、医疗和发展等困难", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://mzj.sm.gov.cn/xwzx/sjdt/202503/t20250310_2105643.htm", "docreltime": "2025.03.05 08:17:00", "doctitle": "用爱呵护成长，用心守护未来 ——我市出台流动儿童关爱保护专项行动实施方案", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2299312, "sourcename": "三明市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://mzj.sm.gov.cn/xwzx/sjdt/202503/t20250310_2105643.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://mzj.sm.gov.cn/xwzx/sjdt/202503/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2098058, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "儿童福利和孤儿基本生活保障", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202501/t20250126_2098058.htm", "content": "\n　　一是深入摸底排查。以市政府办名义下发了《关于进一步健全完善特殊困难群众救助关爱工作机制的通知》（明政办发明电〔2025〕3号），转发了《关于岁末年初加强困难群众巡防关爱和救助帮扶的紧急通知》（闽民救明", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/msfwtp/yysy/etgafw/nclsetgabh/202501/t20250126_2098058.htm", "docreltime": "2025.01.26 11:30:00", "doctitle": "三明市开展寒假春节期间儿童关爱服务", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2290544, "sourcename": "三明市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/msfwtp/yysy/etgafw/nclsetgabh/202501/t20250126_2098058.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "03", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/msfwtp/yysy/etgafw/nclsetgabh/202501/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2090598, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "儿童福利和孤儿基本生活保障", "chnldocurl": "http://mzj.sm.gov.cn/xwzx/sjdt/202412/t20241231_2090598.htm", "content": "\n　　元旦、春节将至，为进一步强化儿童福利机构安全管理工作，12月30日上午，市民政局二级调研员余世科带队前往三明市儿童福利院、三明市角声华恩儿童之家开展安全生产检查。\n　　 \n　　检查组围绕儿童福利机构的住", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://mzj.sm.gov.cn/xwzx/sjdt/202412/t20241231_2090598.htm", "docreltime": "2024.12.30 17:44:00", "doctitle": "把好“节前关”，筑牢“安全线” ——市民政局开展儿童福利机构安全生产检查", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2281431, "sourcename": "三明市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://mzj.sm.gov.cn/xwzx/sjdt/202412/t20241231_2090598.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "微信图片_20250101094540.jpg", "appdocid": 2090598, "appfile": "W020241231353917606871.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://mzj.sm.gov.cn/xwzx/sjdt/202412/t20241231_2090598.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202412/W020241231/W020241231353917606871.jpg", "_href": "http://mzj.sm.gov.cn/xwzx/sjdt/202412/W020241231353917606871.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://mzj.sm.gov.cn/xwzx/sjdt/202412/", "_firstpic": "http://mzj.sm.gov.cn/xwzx/sjdt/202412/W020241231353917606871.jpg", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2052672, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "儿童福利和孤儿基本生活保障", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202408/t20240821_2052672.htm", "content": "\n　　为丰富困境（留守）儿童的暑期生活，三明市各级民政部门立足本地实际，深入实施“福蕾行动计划”“雏燕关爱”行动，开展形式多样、内容丰富的“润心伴成长 同心护未来”儿童关爱服务主题活动，大力提升孩子们的", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202408/t20240821_2052672.htm", "docreltime": "2024.08.21 16:05:00", "doctitle": "关爱困境儿童 共绘快乐暑期", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2231728, "sourcename": "三明市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202408/t20240821_2052672.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "图片6.png", "appdocid": 2052672, "appfile": "W020240821583090598467.png", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202408/t20240821_2052672.htm", "fileext": "png", "_src": "/webpic/W0202408/W020240821/W020240821583090598467.png", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202408/W020240821583090598467.png"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202408/", "_firstpic": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202408/W020240821583090598467.png", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2039779, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "儿童福利和孤儿基本生活保障", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202407/t20240703_2039779.htm", "content": "\n　　近日，市民政局、财政局联合印发《关于调整孤儿基本生活最低养育标准的通知》，自2024年7月1日起，孤儿基本生活最低养育标准在现行标准的基础上，集中养育和散居孤儿基本生活保障标准分别为每人每月2213元和179", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202407/t20240703_2039779.htm", "docreltime": "2024.07.03 08:27:00", "doctitle": "我为群众办实事   孤儿保障标准再提高", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2216858, "sourcename": "三明市民政局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202407/t20240703_2039779.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202407/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2008546, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "儿童福利和孤儿基本生活保障", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202403/t20240311_2008546.htm", "content": "\n　　明民〔2024〕19号\n　　各县（市、区）民政局：\n　　现将《福建省民政厅关于印发〈2024年提高孤儿基本生活最低养育标准并建立自然增长机制实施方案〉的通知》（闽民童〔2024〕28号）转发你们，请认真抓好贯彻落实", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202403/t20240311_2008546.htm", "docreltime": "2024.03.11 16:35:00", "doctitle": "三明市民政局转发福建省民政厅关于印发《2024年提高孤儿基本生活最低养育标准并建立自然增长机制实施方案》的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2180454, "sourcename": "三明市民政局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202403/t20240311_2008546.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202403/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1977407, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "儿童福利和孤儿基本生活保障", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202311/t20231121_1977407.htm", "content": "\n　　明民〔2023〕88号\n　　各县（市、区）民政局、财政局、市儿童福利院：\n　　现将《福建省民政厅 福建省财政厅关于提高孤儿基本生活最低养育标准并建立自然增长机制的通知》（闽民童〔2023〕7号）转发给你们，请认", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202311/t20231121_1977407.htm", "docreltime": "2023.11.20 10:00:00", "doctitle": "三明市民政局 三明市财政局转发福建省民政厅 福建省财政厅关于提高孤儿基本生活最低养育标准并建立自然增长机制的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2142422, "sourcename": "三明市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202311/t20231121_1977407.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202311/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1973222, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "儿童福利和孤儿基本生活保障", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202311/t20231109_1973222.htm", "content": "\n　　明未保委〔2023〕1号\n　　各县（市、区）未成年人保护委员会，市未成年人保护委员会各成员单位：\n　　现将《三明市预防未成年人违法犯罪精准化专项行动方案》印发给你们，请结合工作实际，认真抓好组织实施。\n　", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202311/t20231109_1973222.htm", "docreltime": "2023.08.28 08:53:00", "doctitle": "关于印发《三明市预防未成年人违法犯罪精准化专项行动方案》的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2137579, "sourcename": "三明市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202311/t20231109_1973222.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202311/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1916338, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "儿童