04/t20230410_1894985.htm", "content": "\n　　2月13日,市未成年人保护委员会召开全体会议。会议全面总结2022年全市未成年人保护情况,谋划部署2023年未成年人保护工作。市中级人民法院、市检察院、市委文明办、市教育局、市公安局、市司法局、团市委、市妇联", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202304/t20230410_1894985.htm", "docreltime": "2023.02.14 15:21:00", "doctitle": "三明市未成年人保护委员会召开全体会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2043477, "sourcename": "三明市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202304/t20230410_1894985.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202304/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1872770, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "儿童福利和孤儿基本生活保障", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202301/t20230113_1872770.htm", "content": "    未成年人是祖国的未来、民族的希望、家庭的梦想，保障他们的基本权益是全社会的共同责任。三明市民政局高度重视儿童福利和未成年人保护工作，主动作为谋新策、出实招、求实效，儿童关爱保护工作打开新局面。\n　　", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202301/t20230113_1872770.htm", "docreltime": "2023.01.13 22:24:00", "doctitle": "三明市民政局扎实做好两节期间儿童福利领域关爱工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2015856, "sourcename": "三明市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202301/t20230113_1872770.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "1.jpg", "appdocid": 1872770, "appfile": "W020230113809842074602.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202301/t20230113_1872770.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202301/W020230113/W020230113809842074602.jpg", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202301/W020230113809842074602.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202301/", "_firstpic": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202301/W020230113809842074602.jpg", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1847150, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "儿童福利和孤儿基本生活保障", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202211/t20221116_1847150.htm", "content": "\n　　为帮助机构内病残儿童实现融入社会、回归家庭的美好愿望，我局联合教育、财政、医保、残联等部门出台鼓励家庭收养机构内病残儿童利好政策，给予收养家庭和被依法收养病残儿童相关保障政策，引导更多家庭收养机构", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202211/t20221116_1847150.htm", "docreltime": "2022.11.16 20:00:00", "doctitle": "我市出台鼓励家庭收养机构内病残儿童利好政策", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1982654, "sourcename": "三明市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202211/t20221116_1847150.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202211/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1847149, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "儿童福利和孤儿基本生活保障", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202211/t20221116_1847149.htm", "content": "\n　　一是高效率部署。三明市各级民政部门高度重视村（居）委会妇女和儿童工作委员会设立工作。市民政局主要领导亲自部署协调推动，并提出具体指导意见。各级民政部门层层转发《关于设立村（居）民委员会妇女和儿童工", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202211/t20221116_1847149.htm", "docreltime": "2022.11.01 17:57:00", "doctitle": "三明市率先圆满完成村（居）民委员会妇女和儿童工作委员会设立工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1982653, "sourcename": "三明市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shfl/etflhgejbshbz/202211/t20221116_1847149.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfx